000700*REMARKS.       T+3 FAILS AGING REPORT FOR THE CAGE.
000800*================================================================*
000900* PROGRAM    : TCR990                                            *
001000* TITLE      : AGED OPEN TRADES PAST T+3 (FAILS REPORT)          *
001100* JOB        : MSTCD099                                          *
001200*                                                                *
001300* DESCRIPTION:                                                   *
001400*   BROWSES THE TRADE HISTORY FILE AND LISTS EVERY OPEN TRADE    *
001500*   WHOSE CONTRACTUAL SETTLEMENT DATE (TRADE DATE + 3 BUSINESS   *
001600*   DAYS) IS BEFORE THE BUSINESS DATE, WITH THE NUMBER OF DAYS   *
001700*   FAILED.  REQUESTED BY THE CAGE FOR THE T+5 TO T+3 CHANGE.    *
001800*   AGING BUCKETS 1-5, 6-10, 11-30, OVER 30 BUSINESS DAYS.       *
001900*                                                                *
002000* FILES  : DATECARD  BUSINESS DATE CARD            (CMDATEW)     *
002100*          TRDHIST   MSEC.PROD.TC.TRDHIST.KSDS     (TCTRDHS)     *
002200*          RPTFILE   REPORT FBA 133                              *
002300* CALLS  : CMU010 CMU050 CMU060 CMU080                           *
002400*----------------------------------------------------------------*
002500* CHANGE HISTORY                                                 *
002600* DATE       BY   TICKET    DESCRIPTION                          *
002700* ---------- ---  --------  ------------------------------------ *
002800* 1993-06-07 DWB            ORIGINAL                             *
002900* 1994-01-17 DWB            AGING BUCKETS                        *
003000* 1996-09-09 DWB  CHG02518  SKIP CANCELLED TRADES                *
003100* 1998-12-07 TLM  CHG04471  Y2K - DATES CCYYMMDD                 *
003200* 2002-03-08 KAP  CHG09930  AUDIT AND CONTROL TOTAL CALLS        *
003300*================================================================*
